ai='''<section class="block white" id="ai"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">06 / AI enablement</p><h2>More creative capacity.<br>Less operating friction.</h2></div><p>AI is useful when it improves a real workflow. A bounded pilot has authorized inputs, evaluation criteria, human approval and a named owner — not an invented productivity multiple.</p></div><div class="grid3"><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Research → decision</p><h3>Intelligence that stays attached to its source.</h3><p>Category intelligence, competitor briefs and decision support. Pilot evaluation: accuracy, freshness, review effort and time per useful output.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Content → learning</p><h3>Creative work with an operating feedback loop.</h3><p>Briefs, localized variants and review assistance. Pilot evaluation: production cycle, rework, compliance issues and test coverage.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Data → action</p><h3>Less reporting theatre. More usable context.</h3><p>KPI commentary, anomaly triage and management briefs. Pilot evaluation: exception quality, analyst workload and follow-through.</p></article></div><div class="notice">Web3 scope covers game/product/commercial assessment, not token brokerage, investment returns or smart-contract security certification. AI pilots are not medical services, security audits or automatic production-readiness guarantees.</div></div></section>'''
pricing='''<section class="block" id="pricing"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">07 / Professional judgment, clearly scoped</p><h2>Transparent fees.<br>Real boundaries.</h2></div><p>A 15-minute fit conversation can establish scope and budget. Diagnosis, proprietary-data review, sourcing research and decision advice are paid work — agreed before it begins.</p></div><div class="tools" aria-label="Filter services"><button class="filter active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All services</button><button class="filter" data-filter="advisory" aria-pressed="false">Advisory & projects</button><button class="filter" data-filter="partner" aria-pressed="false">Operating partner</button><button class="filter" data-filter="ai" aria-pressed="false">AI enablement</button><span style="flex:1"></span><button class="currency active" data-currency="cny" aria-pressed="true">CNY</button><button class="currency" data-currency="usd" aria-pressed="false">USD reference</button></div><p id="fx-note" class="small">CNY is the base schedule. Indicative fees exclude applicable taxes and require a written scope.</p><div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label="Service rate table, horizontally scrollable"><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Base fee</th><th>Included scope / capacity</th><th>Next step</th></tr></thead><tbody>'''
