contact='''<section class="block white" id="contact"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">10 / Let's build something meaningful</p><h2>Bring the ambition.<br>And the real question.</h2><p class="closing">Better games.<br>More human possibilities.</p><p>Joyce Mi · Founder, GGC<br><a href="mailto:minyajing@gmail.com">minyajing@gmail.com</a></p><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/minyajing/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a> · <a href="https://opsgo.ggcgames.com/store" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpsGo ↗</a> · <a href="../">GGC ↗</a></p><img class="signature" src="assets/joyce-signature.svg" alt="Joyce signature-style wordmark"><p class="small">This form creates an email brief on your device. It does not send, store, charge or confirm a booking. Please do not include credentials, personal identifiers or confidential materials.</p></div><form class="form" id="intake"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name"><label for="company">Company / product</label><input id="company" name="company" required maxlength="160"><label for="email">Work email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="160" autocomplete="email"><label for="service">Engagement</label><select id="service" name="service">'''+options+'''</select><label for="stage">Market, platform & stage</label><input id="stage" name="stage" required maxlength="300" placeholder="Example: mobile game, US, soft launch"><label for="problem">The decision or KPI</label><textarea id="problem" name="problem" required maxlength="1200" placeholder="Describe the question without confidential details."></textarea><label for="budget">Budget & timing</label><input id="budget" name="budget" maxlength="200"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Create a scope brief →</button><div id="result" class="hidden" aria-live="polite"><p class="small rule">Review your brief before sending.</p><pre id="brief"></pre><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" id="mail-link" href="mailto:minyajing@gmail.com">Open email draft</a><button class="btn" type="button" id="copy">Copy brief</button></div></div></form></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap"><span>© 2026 Joyce / GGC · Global Game Copilot</span><span><a href="docs/PUBLIC-BUSINESS-MASTER.md">Business scope</a> · <a href="docs/VISUAL-SYSTEM.md">Visual system</a> · v2 / 19 Sep 2026</span></div></footer><script src="assets/business-v2.js" defer></script></body></html>'''
